AB  - Following an investigation undertaken by the publisher and after review by the ASTM Committee on Publications, we have determined that the papers cited below that published within the guest-edited “Special Issue on The Future of Cognitive Computing in Healthcare” were accepted solely on the basis of a compromised peer review process. We hereby retract the papers. Reasonable effort should be made to remove references to the papers. The corresponding authors, as the representative of all authors, have been notified of the retraction, and we have kept a record of any responses received. Citation of Retraction Statement: ASTM International, “Retraction of 25 Articles Due to Publication Ethics Concerns,” Journal of Testing and Evaluation 54, no. 2 (March/April 2026): XX–XX, https://doi.org/ 10.1520/JTE20269997 Citations of Retracted Articles: F. Lu, W. Qin, and H. Gong, “Construction and Empirical Analysis of High-Quality Development Evaluation System of Recreational Fisheries in China to Promote the Development of Health Care and Leisure Industry,” Journal of Testing and Evaluation 51, no. 1 (January/February 2023): 3–15, https://doi.org/10.1520/JTE20210418 Y. Deng and P. Liu, “Effect of Different Doses of Vitamin C Supplementation on Health and Performance of Badminton Players Based on Machine Learning,” Journal of Testing and Evaluation 51, no. 1 (January/February 2023): 16–26, https://doi.org/10. 1520/JTE20210466 Z. Pang and J. Chen, “Construction of Preschool Education Resources under the Internet+ Background,” Journal of Testing and Evaluation 51, no. 1 (January/February 2023): 27–38, https://doi.org/10.1520/JTE20210435 P. Ren, “Local Path Planning Method for Unmanned Vehicle Based on Model Predictive Control in Hospital Environment,” Journal of Testing and Evaluation 51, no. 1 (January/February 2023): 39–54, https://doi.org/10. 1520/JTE20210441 L. Wang and W. Liu, “Problems and Countermeasures of Sharing Ideas of the Effectiveness of Ideological and Politica