AB  - GaoFen satellite data, with its excellent data quality and resolution, has become the preferred data for remote sensing applications and has been widely applied [1]. Remote sensing monitoring of mines in China has achieved quarterly or monthly monitoring of key mines nationwide. This article uses GaoFen data to carry out mining land information extraction work in Laos. By comparing the extraction results of different years, the application purpose of satellite dynamic observation of changes in mining activities was achieved. The results indicate that the remote sensing dynamic observation effect of GaoFen satellite data is also good overseas.
