AB  - The rooftop photovoltaic power generation system can convert solar energy into electric energy so as to realize the clean and efficient energy use. To promote the photovoltaic power generation system construction and mine more photovoltaic potential users, this paper proposes a regional rooftop photovoltaic potential user mining method based on the image recognition technology. This method uses the image target recognition technology of the regional high-resolution remote sensing satellite image to extract the roof area information, so as to locate the potential user group and evaluate the regional rooftop photovoltaic power generation capacity. To achieve accurate object recognition, this paper proposes a boundary smoothing-based filtering method for the image prepossessing and uses maximum between-class variance method (OTSU method) based on the gray-scale image threshold for the target recognition. Finally, the effectiveness of the proposed method is verified by the example analysis.
