TI  - AMSSE-Net: Adaptive Multiscale Spatial–Spectral Enhancement Network for Classification of Hyperspectral and LiDAR Data
JO  - IEEE Transactions on Geoscience and Remote Sensing
PY  - 2023
VL  - 61
PB  - IEEE
DO  - 10.1109/TGRS.2023.3331486
