TI  - PTDA: Progressive Pseudo-Label Learning for Cross-Domain Cloud Detection in High-Resolution Remote Sensing
JO  - IEEE Transactions on Geoscience and Remote Sensing
PY  - 2025
VL  - 63
PB  - IEEE
DO  - 10.1109/TGRS.2025.3567159
