TI  - Mapping the Spatiotemporal Patterns of Surface Mining in Resource-Based Cities and Assessing Their Impact on Land Surface Temperature Across the Urban–Rural Gradient
JO  - IEEE Journal of Selected Topics in Applied Earth Observations and Remote Sensing
PY  - 2025
VL  - 18
