TI  - Coal Fire Identification Based on Multisource Remote Sensing Time-Series Features and Hierarchical Feature Optimization: A Case Study in the Zhundong Coalfield
JO  - IEEE Journal of Selected Topics in Applied Earth Observations and Remote Sensing
PY  - 2026
