TI  - Derivation of 3-D Surface Displacements in Mining Areas Using Farneback Optical Flow Method With LuTan-1 Ascending and Descending SAR Imagery
JO  - IEEE Journal of Selected Topics in Applied Earth Observations and Remote Sensing
PY  - 2026
